It also recognizes o followed by a separately tokenized i, including related
alphabetic scripts. DOI and Joi are unusually strong cases. A colon or .org
immediately after DOI retains a response. Some weaker vowel-i fragments and
a small positive offset at document/row openings complete the approximation.
The rules do not attempt to reproduce the remaining contextual variation.
