"""Detect beginnings of absolute paths, with a strong Unix shebang response.

The small suffix state distinguishes shell-script headers, quoted paths, and
root-directory labels. PHP opening tags and doubled middle dots have separate
negative responses. Other text is assigned zero; small context-dependent
activations are deliberately omitted. No token IDs or model weights are used.
